  unitName: Dark Ego Saya
  unitId: 860968
  unitNumber: 8645
  description: "Inmate ID: V-1024-52Charges: Criminal intimidation, aggravated assaultCell:
    Level VNotes: One (1) lethal weapon confiscated \u2014 modified chainsawA rough-speaking,
    tomboyish girl incarcerated in the 13th Correctional Facility following what
    is recorded as a \"large public disturbance escalating to manslaughter.\" Toughened
    by a life of hardship following a difficult childhood, Saya was no stranger to
    frequent clashes with authority, which she abhors for their corruption and complacency.
    However, saying that she dispenses her own personal brand of justice is too noble
    a statement; everyone knows it's every man, woman, and child for themselves on
    these streets.Selfish and suspicious of others, Saya's distrust often leads her
    to doubt their intentions\u2014a trait that has served her well through the years.
    While not averse to violence if provoked, she much prefers intimidation tactics\u2014if
    her swaggering manner won't scare off a thoughtless thug, her massive chainsaw
    certainly will. No one is quite sure where she acquired such a weapon, though
    there are many channels through which illegally modified tools end up in the
    lawless outer city. As Saya puts in her own words: \"No one's gonna help you.
    Talk loudly and carry a huge metal stick. Preferably with metal teeth.\"Reluctantly
    drawn into the mysterious\u2014and punishing\u2014Survivor Games at the behest
    of a mysterious voice over the facility's PA system, Saya's abrasive personality
    seems like a winning formula for reaching the base floor with the correct key.
    At least, she believed so, until she met Ydra..."
  summonDesc: Another survivor?<br>Stay out of my way and no one has to get hurt.
  fusionDesc: You're just gonna give this to me. For free.<br>Weird, but okay.<br>Totally
    not shady.
  evoDesc: Hah! Fully charged!<br>This is going to rip and tear like no other!
  element: 6
  rarity: 7
